["<aside class=\"callout why\"><div class=\"callout-t\">Why it matters</div><p>Skill fades in weeks. A plan turns random range trips into a hunter who hits when it counts.</p></aside><figure class=\"diagram\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 400 300\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"A year timeline. January to March: off season, dry fire and the .22. April to June: build, range days and positions. July to September: tune, field drills, zero and the range test. October to December: season, confirm zero, hunt and log. A marker shows you are here on 11 October. Season dates come from the Rule Book.\">\n<rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"400\" height=\"300\" fill=\"#fffaf0\"/>\n<text x=\"200\" y=\"26\" font-size=\"18\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\" text-anchor=\"middle\">A shooter&#x27;s year in BC</text><text x=\"30\" y=\"70\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\" text-anchor=\"middle\">J</text><text x=\"60\" y=\"70\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\" text-anchor=\"middle\">F</text><text x=\"90\" y=\"70\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\" text-anchor=\"middle\">M</text><text x=\"120\" y=\"70\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\" text-anchor=\"middle\">A</text><text x=\"150\" y=\"70\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\" text-anchor=\"middle\">M</text><text x=\"180\" y=\"70\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\" text-anchor=\"middle\">J</text><text x=\"210\" y=\"70\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\" text-anchor=\"middle\">J</text><text x=\"240\" y=\"70\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\" text-anchor=\"middle\">A</text><text x=\"270\" y=\"70\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\" text-anchor=\"middle\">S</text><text x=\"300\" y=\"70\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\" text-anchor=\"middle\">O</text><text x=\"330\" y=\"70\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\" text-anchor=\"middle\">N</text><text x=\"360\" y=\"70\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\" text-anchor=\"middle\">D</text><rect x=\"18\" y=\"100\" width=\"90\" height=\"22\" rx=\"4\" fill=\"#8a9a6b\" stroke=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><rect x=\"108\" y=\"135\" width=\"90\" height=\"22\" rx=\"4\" fill=\"#4a7fb0\" stroke=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><rect x=\"198\" y=\"170\" width=\"90\" height=\"22\" rx=\"4\" fill=\"#e8590c\" stroke=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><rect x=\"288\" y=\"205\" width=\"90\" height=\"22\" rx=\"4\" fill=\"#b3261e\" stroke=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"22\" y=\"96\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#8a9a6b\" text-anchor=\"start\">Off season: dry fire, .22</text><text x=\"112\" y=\"131\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#4a7fb0\" text-anchor=\"start\">Build: range days, positions</text><text x=\"202\" y=\"166\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#e8590c\" text-anchor=\"start\">Tune: field drills, zero, test</text><text x=\"388\" y=\"201\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#b3261e\" text-anchor=\"end\">Season: confirm, hunt, log</text><line x1=\"300.0\" y1=\"80\" x2=\"300.0\" y2=\"240\" stroke=\"#2f3a2b\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-dasharray=\"5 4\"/><text x=\"300.0\" y=\"258\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\" text-anchor=\"middle\">you are here: 11 Oct</text><text x=\"200.0\" y=\"284\" font-size=\"13\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Season dates: see the Rule Book for your area</text>\n</svg>\n</figure><ul><li>Off season, build, tune, season (opinion).</li><li>Today is 11 October. First hunts are mid to late October.</li></ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>More: how this plan fits</summary><ul><li>Your first hunts: mid to late October 2026 (owner's plan). So this lesson has two parts: a 10 day sprint now, and a full year plan after.</li><li>The basics: four positions, dry fire safety and a four week plan in <a href=\"#/s/shooting-skills/0\">shooting skills</a>; clay practice in <a href=\"#/s/shotgun-skills/0\">shotgun skills</a>; field drills in <a href=\"#/s/field-positions/0\">shooting positions and rests</a>.</li><li>Season dates: never from this lesson. See the <a href=\"#/s/rb-region-3/0\">Rule Book</a> for Region 3 and your other areas.</li><li>All schedules here are Hunt Mentor opinion, built on the sources at the end.</li></ul></details>","<figure class=\"diagram\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 400 300\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"A 10 day sprint before the first hunts. Day 1: confirm zero at 100 m with 3 shots. Days 2 to 4: 10 minutes of dry fire, sticks and get downs. Day 5: range with a cold plate shot, then 150 and 200 m. Days 6 to 8: dry fire and pattern the shotgun once. Day 9: gear check and inspect rounds. Day 10: rest, pack, sleep.\">\n<rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"400\" height=\"300\" fill=\"#fffaf0\"/>\n<text x=\"200\" y=\"26\" font-size=\"18\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\" text-anchor=\"middle\">First hunts soon: a 10 day sprint</text><rect x=\"14\" y=\"44\" width=\"372\" height=\"32\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#dfe6d3\" stroke=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><rect x=\"14\" y=\"44\" width=\"8\" height=\"34\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"#e8590c\" stroke=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"32\" y=\"66\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#e8590c\" text-anchor=\"start\">Day 1</text><text x=\"140\" y=\"66\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#23261f\" text-anchor=\"start\">Confirm zero, 100 m, 3 shots</text><rect x=\"14\" y=\"82\" width=\"372\" height=\"32\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#dfe6d3\" stroke=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><rect x=\"14\" y=\"82\" width=\"8\" height=\"34\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"#4a7fb0\" stroke=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"32\" y=\"104\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#4a7fb0\" text-anchor=\"start\">Days 2 to 4</text><text x=\"140\" y=\"104\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#23261f\" text-anchor=\"start\">Dry fire 10 min, sticks, get downs</text><rect x=\"14\" y=\"120\" width=\"372\" height=\"32\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#dfe6d3\" stroke=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><rect x=\"14\" y=\"120\" width=\"8\" height=\"34\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"#e8590c\" stroke=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"32\" y=\"142\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#e8590c\" text-anchor=\"start\">Day 5</text><text x=\"140\" y=\"142\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#23261f\" text-anchor=\"start\">Range: cold plate, 150 and 200 m</text><rect x=\"14\" y=\"158\" width=\"372\" height=\"32\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#dfe6d3\" stroke=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><rect x=\"14\" y=\"158\" width=\"8\" height=\"34\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"#4a7fb0\" stroke=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"32\" y=\"180\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#4a7fb0\" text-anchor=\"start\">Days 6 to 8</text><text x=\"140\" y=\"180\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#23261f\" text-anchor=\"start\">Dry fire, pattern shotgun once</text><rect x=\"14\" y=\"196\" width=\"372\" height=\"32\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#dfe6d3\" stroke=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><rect x=\"14\" y=\"196\" width=\"8\" height=\"34\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"#8a9a6b\" stroke=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"32\" y=\"218\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#8a9a6b\" text-anchor=\"start\">Day 9</text><text x=\"140\" y=\"218\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#23261f\" text-anchor=\"start\">Gear check, rounds inspected</text><rect x=\"14\" y=\"234\" width=\"372\" height=\"32\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#dfe6d3\" stroke=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><rect x=\"14\" y=\"234\" width=\"8\" height=\"34\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\" stroke=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"32\" y=\"256\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\" text-anchor=\"start\">Day 10</text><text x=\"140\" y=\"256\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#23261f\" text-anchor=\"start\">Rest. Pack. Sleep.</text><text x=\"200.0\" y=\"290\" font-size=\"13\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Opinion: a plan, not a rule</text>\n</svg>\n</figure><ul><li>Two short range days, eight dry nights (opinion).</li><li>Do not change anything new before the hunt (Tip).</li></ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>More: the sprint in full</summary><div class=\"tbl\"><table><thead><tr><th>Day</th><th>Do</th><th>Rounds</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>1</td><td>Confirm zero at 100 m, 3 shots, cold barrel</td><td>3 to 6</td></tr><tr><td>2 to 4</td><td>Dry fire 10 min: sticks, sitting, get downs</td><td>0</td></tr><tr><td>5</td><td>Range: 1 cold plate shot, then 3 at 150 m, 3 at 200 m from sticks</td><td>7 to 10</td></tr><tr><td>6 to 8</td><td>Dry fire 10 min. Pattern the shotgun once if ducks are in your plan</td><td>0 rifle, 5 shotgun</td></tr><tr><td>9</td><td>Gear check. Inspect and wipe every round. Scope screws marked</td><td>0</td></tr><tr><td>10</td><td>Rest. Pack. Sleep early</td><td>0</td></tr></tbody></table></div><ul><li>Do not switch loads, scopes or rings this close to the hunt. Each change needs a new zero <span class=\"cert c-lo\" title=\"Certainty\">75%</span>.</li><li>If the 200 m group is bigger than 20 cm from sticks, your limit this season is 150 m (opinion, from the <a href=\"#/s/shooting-skills/0\">range test</a>).</li></ul></details>","<figure class=\"diagram\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 400 300\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Three pillars hold up your skill. Dry fire: free, at home, for trigger and positions. Range: live rounds for zero, distance and recoil. Field: real ground with slopes, grass and wind. Most reps should be dry; live rounds confirm.\">\n<rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"400\" height=\"300\" fill=\"#fffaf0\"/>\n<text x=\"200\" y=\"26\" font-size=\"18\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Three pillars of practice</text><rect x=\"20\" y=\"70\" width=\"112\" height=\"170\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#dfe6d3\" stroke=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><rect x=\"20\" y=\"70\" width=\"112\" height=\"30\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#4a7fb0\" stroke=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"76\" y=\"91\" font-size=\"16\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#ffffff\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Dry fire</text><text x=\"76\" y=\"140\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#23261f\" text-anchor=\"middle\">free, at home</text><text x=\"76\" y=\"162\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\" text-anchor=\"middle\">trigger, positions</text><rect x=\"144\" y=\"70\" width=\"112\" height=\"170\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#dfe6d3\" stroke=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><rect x=\"144\" y=\"70\" width=\"112\" height=\"30\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#e8590c\" stroke=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"200\" y=\"91\" font-size=\"16\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#ffffff\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Range</text><text x=\"200\" y=\"140\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#23261f\" text-anchor=\"middle\">live rounds</text><text x=\"200\" y=\"162\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\" text-anchor=\"middle\">zero, recoil</text><rect x=\"268\" y=\"70\" width=\"112\" height=\"170\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#dfe6d3\" stroke=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><rect x=\"268\" y=\"70\" width=\"112\" height=\"30\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#2f6e3b\" stroke=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"324\" y=\"91\" font-size=\"16\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#ffffff\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Field</text><text x=\"324\" y=\"140\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#23261f\" text-anchor=\"middle\">real ground</text><text x=\"324\" y=\"162\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\" text-anchor=\"middle\">slopes, wind</text><rect x=\"10\" y=\"240\" width=\"380\" height=\"14\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\" stroke=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><rect x=\"30\" y=\"50\" width=\"340\" height=\"14\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\" stroke=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"200.0\" y=\"284\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Most reps dry. Live rounds confirm.</text>\n</svg>\n</figure><ul><li>Dry fire: most of the reps, free (opinion).</li><li>Range: confirms with real recoil (opinion).</li><li>Field: teaches real ground (opinion).</li></ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>More: why the mix matters</summary><ul><li>Dry fire builds the trigger press and position habits with no ammunition (Tip). Tikka says use a snap cap <span class=\"cert c-hi\" title=\"Certainty\">95%</span>. CZ says it does not recommend frequent dry firing and to use snap caps made for it <span class=\"cert c-hi\" title=\"Certainty\">95%</span>.</li><li>Range days add recoil, noise, real wind and real distance (Tip).</li><li>Field practice adds slopes, grass, cold hands and a racing heart (Tip).</li><li>A rough ratio that works: 5 dry sessions for every live session (opinion).</li></ul></details>","<div class=\"steps\" data-n=\"4\"><div class=\"steps-head\"><b>Set up dry fire in 4 steps</b><span class=\"steps-count\">1 of 4</span></div><div class=\"steps-track\"><figure class=\"step-frame\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 400 300\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Take every round out of the room. Magazines empty, pockets empty.\">\n<rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"400\" height=\"300\" fill=\"#fffaf0\"/>\n<text x=\"200\" y=\"26\" font-size=\"18\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\" text-anchor=\"middle\">1. All ammo out of the room</text><rect x=\"130\" y=\"90\" width=\"140\" height=\"90\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#6b4f35\" stroke=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"200\" y=\"140\" font-size=\"22\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#ffffff\" text-anchor=\"middle\">AMMO</text><line x1=\"270\" y1=\"135\" x2=\"360\" y2=\"135\" stroke=\"#e8590c\" stroke-width=\"4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><path d=\"M351.9 138.9 L360 135 L351.9 131.1\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#e8590c\" stroke-width=\"4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/><text x=\"200\" y=\"230\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\" text-anchor=\"middle\">other room, door closed</text>\n</svg>\n<figcaption><b>1.</b> All ammunition out of the room.</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"step-frame\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 400 300\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Prove the rifle unloaded, then chamber a snap cap.\">\n<rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"400\" height=\"300\" fill=\"#fffaf0\"/>\n<text x=\"200\" y=\"26\" font-size=\"18\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\" text-anchor=\"middle\">2. Prove it, snap cap in</text><g transform=\"translate(120 140) scale(1.1)\"><path d=\"M0 -14 L86 -14 L100 -9 L104 -9 L104 9 L100 9 L86 14 L0 14 Z\" fill=\"#c9a227\" stroke=\"#2f3a2b\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/><rect x=\"-4\" y=\"-16\" width=\"6\" height=\"32\" rx=\"0\" fill=\"#c9a227\" stroke=\"#2f3a2b\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><rect x=\"4\" y=\"-14\" width=\"3\" height=\"28\" rx=\"0\" fill=\"#a88520\" stroke=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><path d=\"M104 -8 L120 -8 Q 140 -6 146 0 Q 140 6 120 8 L104 8 Z\" fill=\"#b87333\" stroke=\"#2f3a2b\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/></g><rect x=\"120\" y=\"130\" width=\"6\" height=\"20\" rx=\"0\" fill=\"#b3261e\" stroke=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"200\" y=\"220\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\" text-anchor=\"middle\">snap cap: orange or red dummy</text>\n</svg>\n<figcaption><b>2.</b> Prove it unloaded. Snap cap in.</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"step-frame\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 400 300\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Aim at a small dot on a wall that would stop a bullet. Never a window or a door.\">\n<rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"400\" height=\"300\" fill=\"#fffaf0\"/>\n<text x=\"200\" y=\"26\" font-size=\"18\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\" text-anchor=\"middle\">3. Safe wall, small dot</text><rect x=\"80\" y=\"60\" width=\"240\" height=\"160\" rx=\"0\" fill=\"#e9e2d0\" stroke=\"#2f3a2b\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><circle cx=\"200\" cy=\"140\" r=\"6\" fill=\"#e8590c\" stroke=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"200\" y=\"250\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\" text-anchor=\"middle\">basement wall, not a window</text>\n</svg>\n<figcaption><b>3.</b> Aim at a safe wall, never a window.</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"step-frame\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 400 300\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Ten minutes of slow presses. Say finished out loud, snap cap out, rifle locked away.\">\n<rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"400\" height=\"300\" fill=\"#fffaf0\"/>\n<text x=\"200\" y=\"26\" font-size=\"18\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\" text-anchor=\"middle\">4. 10 minutes, then say finished</text><text x=\"200\" y=\"130\" font-size=\"48\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\" text-anchor=\"middle\">10:00</text><text x=\"200\" y=\"200\" font-size=\"17\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#e8590c\" text-anchor=\"middle\">&quot;Finished.&quot; Snap cap out.</text><text x=\"200\" y=\"230\" font-size=\"15\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\" text-anchor=\"middle\">rifle locked away first</text>\n</svg>\n<figcaption><b>4.</b> 10 minutes. Say finished. Lock it away.</figcaption></figure></div><div class=\"steps-nav\"><button class=\"steps-prev\" aria-label=\"Back\">‹ Back</button><span class=\"steps-dots\"><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i></span><button class=\"steps-next\" aria-label=\"Next\">Next ›</button></div></div><aside class=\"callout warn\"><div class=\"callout-t\">Warning</div><p>Dry fire is only safe with zero ammunition in the room. Every session.</p></aside><details class=\"more\"><summary>More: dry fire rules in full</summary><ol><li>Every round out of the room, magazines and pockets empty (Tip, from <a href=\"#/s/shooting-skills/0\">shooting skills</a>).</li><li><button class=\"term\" data-term=\"PROVE\">PROVE</button> the rifle unloaded. Snap cap in the chamber. Tikka: \"'Snap cap' cartridges with spring loaded 'primers' are ideal\" <span class=\"cert c-hi\" title=\"Certainty\">95%</span>.</li><li>Aim at a spot on a wall that would stop a bullet, never at a window, door or person (Tip).</li><li>Ten minutes, then say \"finished\" out loud, snap cap out, rifle locked away before ammunition returns (Tip).</li><li>Dummy rounds with empty primer pockets are good for loading practice but do not protect the firing pin (95%, Tikka manual).</li><li>CZ 457: same idea, snap caps made for rimfire (95%, CZ manual).</li></ol></details>","<div class=\"tbl\"><table><thead><tr><th>Session</th><th>10 minutes of</th><th>Goal</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>A</td><td>10 presses each: prone, sitting, sticks</td><td>Crosshair still at the click</td></tr><tr><td>B</td><td>10 get downs to sticks, timer on</td><td>Under 5 seconds</td></tr><tr><td>C</td><td>10 NPOA checks, then 1 press each</td><td>Settles on target</td></tr><tr><td>D</td><td>Shotgun: 20 mounts to a corner of the room</td><td>Eye on the line, gun meets the eye</td></tr></tbody></table></div><ul><li>Rotate A, B, C, D (opinion).</li></ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>More: the menu in detail</summary><ul><li>A: watch the crosshair at the moment of the click. Any jump is the trigger finger or a flinch (Tip).</li><li>B: from standing, rifle slung. Ends with the safety still on until you are on target (95% for the safety rule).</li><li>C: natural point of aim drill from <a href=\"#/s/field-positions/0\">positions and rests</a> <span class=\"cert c-mid\" title=\"Certainty\">80%</span>.</li><li>D: shotgun mounts, unloaded and proved. Eyes stay on a target, the gun comes to the cheek (Tip). See <a href=\"#/s/shotgun-mastery/0\">shotgun mastery</a>.</li></ul></details>","<figure class=\"diagram\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 400 300\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"A 90 minute range day timeline. First 10 minutes: one cold shot. Then a zero check, then positions, then distance shots, then the shotgun or the .22 for the last 20 minutes. About 20 rifle rounds and 25 shotgun shells. Write results before you leave.\">\n<rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"400\" height=\"300\" fill=\"#fffaf0\"/>\n<text x=\"200\" y=\"26\" font-size=\"18\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\" text-anchor=\"middle\">One range day, 90 minutes</text><rect x=\"20\" y=\"110\" width=\"40\" height=\"50\" rx=\"4\" fill=\"#b3261e\" stroke=\"#fffaf0\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"40.0\" y=\"100\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#b3261e\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Cold shot</text><rect x=\"60\" y=\"110\" width=\"60\" height=\"50\" rx=\"4\" fill=\"#e8590c\" stroke=\"#fffaf0\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"90.0\" y=\"186\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#e8590c\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Zero check</text><rect x=\"120\" y=\"110\" width=\"100\" height=\"50\" rx=\"4\" fill=\"#4a7fb0\" stroke=\"#fffaf0\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"170.0\" y=\"100\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#4a7fb0\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Positions</text><rect x=\"220\" y=\"110\" width=\"80\" height=\"50\" rx=\"4\" fill=\"#2f6e3b\" stroke=\"#fffaf0\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"260.0\" y=\"186\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#2f6e3b\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Distance</text><rect x=\"300\" y=\"110\" width=\"80\" height=\"50\" rx=\"4\" fill=\"#8a9a6b\" stroke=\"#fffaf0\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"340.0\" y=\"100\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#8a9a6b\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Shotgun or .22</text><text x=\"20\" y=\"210\" font-size=\"13\" fill=\"#23261f\" text-anchor=\"middle\">0 min</text><text x=\"140\" y=\"210\" font-size=\"13\" fill=\"#23261f\" text-anchor=\"middle\">30 min</text><text x=\"260\" y=\"210\" font-size=\"13\" fill=\"#23261f\" text-anchor=\"middle\">60 min</text><text x=\"380\" y=\"210\" font-size=\"13\" fill=\"#23261f\" text-anchor=\"middle\">90 min</text><text x=\"200\" y=\"240\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\" text-anchor=\"middle\">About 20 rifle rounds, 25 shotgun shells</text><text x=\"200\" y=\"258\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Write results before you leave</text>\n</svg>\n</figure><ul><li>Cold shot first. It is the only one a deer gives you (Tip).</li></ul><ul><li>Write it all down before you leave (Tip).</li></ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>More: the range day in full</summary><ol><li><strong>Cold shot (10 min):</strong> first shot of the day, from sticks or sitting, at your usual hunting distance. Log it (Tip).</li><li><strong>Zero check (15 min):</strong> 3 shots at 100 m from a rest. Adjust only if the group centre is off by more than about 2.5 cm (opinion).</li><li><strong>Positions (25 min):</strong> the position ladder from the drills lesson (opinion).</li><li><strong>Distance (20 min):</strong> 150 m and 200 m from sticks. Check your dope card numbers (<a href=\"#/s/ballistics-deep/0\">ballistics deep dive</a>).</li><li><strong>Shotgun or .22 (20 min):</strong> clays, or .22 position practice at 50 m (opinion).</li><li>Hunter education: confirm the zero from a solid bench with the forestock on a pad or sandbag; never rest the barrel itself <span class=\"cert c-mid\" title=\"Certainty\">85%</span>.</li><li>Ranges near you: listed in <a href=\"#/s/sighting-in/0\">sighting in</a>. Hours and fees: <span class=\"verify\">VERIFY</span> before you drive.</li></ol></details>","<div class=\"checklist\" data-list=\"ff-pp-range-bag\"><label class=\"check\"><input type=\"checkbox\" data-key=\"ff-pp-range-bag:0\"><span>Rifle, bolt, magazine, snap cap</span></label><label class=\"check\"><input type=\"checkbox\" data-key=\"ff-pp-range-bag:1\"><span>Hunting load, 20 rounds, same lot</span></label><label class=\"check\"><input type=\"checkbox\" data-key=\"ff-pp-range-bag:2\"><span>Sticks and the pack you hunt with</span></label><label class=\"check\"><input type=\"checkbox\" data-key=\"ff-pp-range-bag:3\"><span>Targets, 20 cm plates, stapler</span></label><label class=\"check\"><input type=\"checkbox\" data-key=\"ff-pp-range-bag:4\"><span>Ear and eye protection</span></label><label class=\"check\"><input type=\"checkbox\" data-key=\"ff-pp-range-bag:5\"><span>Spotting scope or binoculars</span></label><label class=\"check\"><input type=\"checkbox\" data-key=\"ff-pp-range-bag:6\"><span>Journal and pencil</span></label><label class=\"check\"><input type=\"checkbox\" data-key=\"ff-pp-range-bag:7\"><span>Rangefinder</span></label><label class=\"check\"><input type=\"checkbox\" data-key=\"ff-pp-range-bag:8\"><span>Shotgun, plug in, shells, chokes and wrench</span></label></div>","<figure class=\"diagram\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 400 300\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"A field course with four stations: prone at 100 m, sticks at 150 m, sitting at 200 m, and an uphill shot. Walk between stations. Only where a range allows this.\">\n<rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"400\" height=\"300\" fill=\"#fffaf0\"/>\n<text x=\"200\" y=\"26\" font-size=\"18\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\" text-anchor=\"middle\">A field course on a lawful range</text><path d=\"M10 250 L390 250 L390 150 Q 300 120 200 160 Q 100 200 10 170 Z\" fill=\"#dfe6d3\" stroke=\"#8a9a6b\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/><circle cx=\"70\" cy=\"200\" r=\"14\" fill=\"#fffaf0\" stroke=\"#e8590c\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><text x=\"70\" y=\"205\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#e8590c\" text-anchor=\"middle\">1</text><text x=\"70\" y=\"178\" font-size=\"12\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\" text-anchor=\"middle\">1 prone 100 m</text><circle cx=\"170\" cy=\"180\" r=\"14\" fill=\"#fffaf0\" stroke=\"#e8590c\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><text x=\"170\" y=\"185\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#e8590c\" text-anchor=\"middle\">2</text><text x=\"170\" y=\"158\" font-size=\"12\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\" text-anchor=\"middle\">2 sticks 150 m</text><circle cx=\"260\" cy=\"150\" r=\"14\" fill=\"#fffaf0\" stroke=\"#e8590c\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><text x=\"260\" y=\"155\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#e8590c\" text-anchor=\"middle\">3</text><text x=\"260\" y=\"128\" font-size=\"12\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\" text-anchor=\"middle\">3 sitting 200 m</text><circle cx=\"340\" cy=\"140\" r=\"14\" fill=\"#fffaf0\" stroke=\"#e8590c\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><text x=\"340\" y=\"145\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#e8590c\" text-anchor=\"middle\">4</text><text x=\"340\" y=\"118\" font-size=\"12\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\" text-anchor=\"middle\">4 uphill</text><path d=\"M70 214 Q 120 230 170 194 Q 220 200 260 164 Q 300 170 340 154\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#2f3a2b\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-dasharray=\"5 4\"/><text x=\"200.0\" y=\"284\" font-size=\"13\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Only where the range allows it. Walk between stations.</text>\n</svg>\n</figure><ul><li>Only on a range or land where shooting is lawful and safe <span class=\"cert c-hi\" title=\"Certainty\">95%</span>.</li><li>Walk between stations to raise your heart rate (Tip).</li></ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>More: field shooting in full</summary><ul><li>Shooting outside a range: you need a place where discharge is lawful and a safe <button class=\"term\" data-term=\"Backstop\">Backstop</button>. BC has discharge bylaws and No Shooting Areas (99%, <a href=\"#/s/rb-where-you-can-hunt/0\">Rule Book: where you can and cannot hunt</a>). If unsure, use a club range.</li><li>Many clubs have field or silhouette courses. Ask at your club (Tip).</li><li>Shoot in your hunting clothes, gloves and pack. Cold fingers change the trigger press (Tip).</li><li>Steep ground: practise one angled shot each session if the range has a slope (Tip).</li></ul></details>","<figure class=\"diagram\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 400 300\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Two common shotgun misses. Left: stopping the swing puts the shot behind the duck; fix by keeping the gun moving. Right: lifting your head puts the shot over the top; fix by keeping your cheek on the stock.\">\n<rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"400\" height=\"300\" fill=\"#fffaf0\"/>\n<text x=\"200\" y=\"24\" font-size=\"17\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#23261f\">Two misses that cause most of the rest</text><rect x=\"8\" y=\"40\" width=\"188\" height=\"240\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#fffaf0\" stroke=\"#8a9a6b\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"102\" y=\"64\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#23261f\">Stopped the swing</text><g transform=\"translate(88 150) scale(1.1)\"><ellipse cx=\"0\" cy=\"0\" rx=\"20\" ry=\"8\" fill=\"#23261f\"/><circle cx=\"-21\" cy=\"-5\" r=\"6\" fill=\"#23261f\"/><path d=\"M-27 -5 L-36 -3 L-27 -1 Z\" fill=\"#e8590c\"/><path d=\"M-4 -3 L6 -24 L14 -4 Z\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\"/></g><line x1=\"68\" y1=\"196\" x2=\"28.0\" y2=\"196.0\" stroke=\"#2f3a2b\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><path d=\"M36.1 192.1 L28.0 196.0 L36.1 199.9\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#2f3a2b\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/><text x=\"78\" y=\"200\" font-size=\"13\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\">flight</text><circle cx=\"162.2\" cy=\"136.8\" r=\"2.4\" fill=\"#23261f\"/><circle cx=\"139.6\" cy=\"160.0\" r=\"2.4\" fill=\"#23261f\"/><circle cx=\"143.3\" cy=\"145.7\" r=\"2.4\" fill=\"#23261f\"/><circle cx=\"154.1\" cy=\"146.4\" r=\"2.4\" fill=\"#23261f\"/><circle cx=\"151.4\" cy=\"138.3\" r=\"2.4\" fill=\"#23261f\"/><circle cx=\"169.5\" cy=\"153.8\" r=\"2.4\" fill=\"#23261f\"/><circle cx=\"146.4\" cy=\"142.3\" r=\"2.4\" fill=\"#23261f\"/><circle cx=\"142.8\" cy=\"155.5\" r=\"2.4\" fill=\"#23261f\"/><circle cx=\"151.7\" cy=\"138.6\" r=\"2.4\" fill=\"#23261f\"/><circle cx=\"155.4\" cy=\"134.9\" r=\"2.4\" fill=\"#23261f\"/><circle cx=\"141.5\" cy=\"151.8\" r=\"2.4\" fill=\"#23261f\"/><circle cx=\"149.3\" cy=\"142.2\" r=\"2.4\" fill=\"#23261f\"/><circle cx=\"164.8\" cy=\"156.9\" r=\"2.4\" fill=\"#23261f\"/><circle cx=\"165.8\" cy=\"148.5\" r=\"2.4\" fill=\"#23261f\"/><text x=\"153\" y=\"120\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#23261f\">shot</text><text x=\"102\" y=\"236\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#b3261e\">Shot goes behind</text><text x=\"102\" y=\"262\" font-size=\"14\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\">Fix: keep swinging</text><rect x=\"204\" y=\"40\" width=\"188\" height=\"240\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#fffaf0\" stroke=\"#8a9a6b\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"298\" y=\"64\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#23261f\">Lifted the head</text><g transform=\"translate(284 150) scale(1.1)\"><ellipse cx=\"0\" cy=\"0\" rx=\"20\" ry=\"8\" fill=\"#23261f\"/><circle cx=\"-21\" cy=\"-5\" r=\"6\" fill=\"#23261f\"/><path d=\"M-27 -5 L-36 -3 L-27 -1 Z\" fill=\"#e8590c\"/><path d=\"M-4 -3 L6 -24 L14 -4 Z\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\"/></g><line x1=\"264\" y1=\"196\" x2=\"224.0\" y2=\"196.0\" stroke=\"#2f3a2b\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><path d=\"M232.1 192.1 L224.0 196.0 L232.1 199.9\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#2f3a2b\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/><text x=\"274\" y=\"200\" font-size=\"13\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\">flight</text><circle cx=\"273.7\" cy=\"99.6\" r=\"2.4\" fill=\"#23261f\"/><circle cx=\"267.5\" cy=\"84.7\" r=\"2.4\" fill=\"#23261f\"/><circle cx=\"277.5\" cy=\"110.7\" r=\"2.4\" fill=\"#23261f\"/><circle cx=\"265.2\" cy=\"112.5\" r=\"2.4\" fill=\"#23261f\"/><circle cx=\"265.8\" cy=\"101.7\" r=\"2.4\" fill=\"#23261f\"/><circle cx=\"282.5\" cy=\"89.8\" r=\"2.4\" fill=\"#23261f\"/><circle cx=\"254.8\" cy=\"93.0\" r=\"2.4\" fill=\"#23261f\"/><circle cx=\"255.7\" cy=\"111.7\" r=\"2.4\" fill=\"#23261f\"/><circle cx=\"265.7\" cy=\"81.4\" r=\"2.4\" fill=\"#23261f\"/><circle cx=\"268.1\" cy=\"82.6\" r=\"2.4\" fill=\"#23261f\"/><circle cx=\"261.9\" cy=\"80.9\" r=\"2.4\" fill=\"#23261f\"/><circle cx=\"252.9\" cy=\"81.0\" r=\"2.4\" fill=\"#23261f\"/><circle cx=\"261.8\" cy=\"103.4\" r=\"2.4\" fill=\"#23261f\"/><circle cx=\"255.8\" cy=\"80.2\" r=\"2.4\" fill=\"#23261f\"/><text x=\"324\" y=\"98\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#23261f\">shot</text><text x=\"298\" y=\"236\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#b3261e\">Shot goes high</text><text x=\"298\" y=\"262\" font-size=\"14\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\">Fix: cheek on the stock</text>\n</svg>\n</figure><ul><li>Six clay sessions before the season make a difference <span class=\"cert c-lo\" title=\"Certainty\">70%</span>.</li><li>Pattern once with your hunting choke and shell <span class=\"cert c-mid\" title=\"Certainty\">85%</span>.</li></ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>More: shotgun practice in full</summary><ul><li>The clay plan (skeet, trap, sporting clays) is in <a href=\"#/s/shotgun-skills/0\">shotgun skills</a> <span class=\"cert c-lo\" title=\"Certainty\">70%</span>.</li><li>Patterning: <a href=\"#/s/sighting-in/0\">sighting in and patterning</a> and <a href=\"#/s/shotgun-mastery/0\">shotgun mastery</a>.</li><li>Ducks and upland on the same trip: steel only in the shell bag (Tip, from the <a href=\"#/s/ammo-guide/0\">ammo session</a>).</li></ul></details>","<figure class=\"diagram\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 400 300\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Bar chart of the cost of one shot in Canadian dollars: .308 hunting ammunition $2.05 to $2.75, a steel duck shell $1.20 to $1.40, an upland lead shell $0.68 to $0.88, a .22 long rifle round $0.14 to $0.17, and dry fire about nothing.\">\n<rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"400\" height=\"300\" fill=\"#fffaf0\"/>\n<text x=\"200\" y=\"26\" font-size=\"18\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\" text-anchor=\"middle\">What one shot costs (CAD)</text><text x=\"144\" y=\"73.6\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#23261f\" text-anchor=\"end\">.308 hunting</text><rect x=\"150\" y=\"54\" width=\"142.24137931034483\" height=\"28\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"#e8590c\" stroke=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"298.2413793103448\" y=\"73.6\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#23261f\" text-anchor=\"start\">$2.05 to $2.75</text><text x=\"144\" y=\"115.6\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#23261f\" text-anchor=\"end\">Steel duck shell</text><rect x=\"150\" y=\"96\" width=\"72.41379310344828\" height=\"28\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"#e8590c\" stroke=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"228.41379310344828\" y=\"115.6\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#23261f\" text-anchor=\"start\">$1.20 to $1.40</text><text x=\"144\" y=\"157.6\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#23261f\" text-anchor=\"end\">Upland lead shell</text><rect x=\"150\" y=\"138\" width=\"45.51724137931035\" height=\"28\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"#e8590c\" stroke=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"201.51724137931035\" y=\"157.6\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#23261f\" text-anchor=\"start\">$0.68 to $0.88</text><text x=\"144\" y=\"199.6\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#23261f\" text-anchor=\"end\">.22 LR Mini Mag</text><rect x=\"150\" y=\"180\" width=\"8.793103448275863\" height=\"28\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"#4a7fb0\" stroke=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"164.79310344827587\" y=\"199.6\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#23261f\" text-anchor=\"start\">$0.14 to $0.17</text><text x=\"144\" y=\"241.6\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#23261f\" text-anchor=\"end\">Dry fire</text><rect x=\"150\" y=\"222\" width=\"2\" height=\"28\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"#2f6e3b\" stroke=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"158\" y=\"241.6\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#23261f\" text-anchor=\"start\">$0</text><text x=\"200.0\" y=\"284\" font-size=\"13\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Prices: ammo session, checked 2026-10-01</text>\n</svg>\n</figure><ul><li>A .22 round costs about a fifteenth of a .308 round <span class=\"cert c-lo\" title=\"Certainty\">65%</span>.</li><li>Same positions, same trigger habits, no recoil (Tip).</li></ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>More: using the .22 in full</summary><ul><li>Prices from the <a href=\"#/s/ammo-guide/0\">ammo session</a>, checked 2026-10-01: .308 hunting $40.99 to $54.99 for 20, CCI Mini Mag .22 LR (long rifle) $13.79 to $16.99 for 100 <span class=\"cert c-lo\" title=\"Certainty\">65%</span>.</li><li>Per shot: about $2.05 to $2.75 versus $0.14 to $0.17 (65%, arithmetic).</li><li>Run the position ladder and get down drills with the CZ 457 at 50 m (opinion).</li><li>No recoil means the .22 hides a flinch. Mix in a few .308 shots every session (Tip).</li><li>More on the CZ: <a href=\"#/s/rimfire-22/0\">the .22 rimfire</a>.</li></ul></details>","<figure class=\"diagram\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 400 300\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"A practice log with columns for date, position, distance, wind and result. Example rows: sticks at 150 m, hit; sitting at 200 m, 4 cm low; prone at 200 m, hit. After about 20 entries patterns show: low misses often mean trigger, sideways misses often mean wind or natural point of aim. These are tips.\">\n<rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"400\" height=\"300\" fill=\"#fffaf0\"/>\n<text x=\"200\" y=\"26\" font-size=\"18\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Log every shot that counts</text><text x=\"60\" y=\"72\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#e8590c\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Date</text><text x=\"132\" y=\"72\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#e8590c\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Pos</text><text x=\"204\" y=\"72\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#e8590c\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Dist</text><text x=\"276\" y=\"72\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#e8590c\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Wind</text><text x=\"348\" y=\"72\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#e8590c\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Hit?</text><text x=\"60\" y=\"108\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#23261f\" text-anchor=\"middle\">10 Oct</text><text x=\"132\" y=\"108\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#23261f\" text-anchor=\"middle\">sticks</text><text x=\"204\" y=\"108\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#23261f\" text-anchor=\"middle\">150</text><text x=\"276\" y=\"108\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#23261f\" text-anchor=\"middle\">10 L</text><text x=\"348\" y=\"108\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#23261f\" text-anchor=\"middle\">yes</text><line x1=\"24\" y1=\"116\" x2=\"376\" y2=\"116\" stroke=\"#d9d4c7\" stroke-width=\"1\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><text x=\"60\" y=\"142\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#23261f\" text-anchor=\"middle\">10 Oct</text><text x=\"132\" y=\"142\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#23261f\" text-anchor=\"middle\">sit</text><text x=\"204\" y=\"142\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#23261f\" text-anchor=\"middle\">200</text><text x=\"276\" y=\"142\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#23261f\" text-anchor=\"middle\">10 L</text><text x=\"348\" y=\"142\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#23261f\" text-anchor=\"middle\">4 low</text><line x1=\"24\" y1=\"150\" x2=\"376\" y2=\"150\" stroke=\"#d9d4c7\" stroke-width=\"1\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><text x=\"60\" y=\"176\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#23261f\" text-anchor=\"middle\">12 Oct</text><text x=\"132\" y=\"176\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#23261f\" text-anchor=\"middle\">prone</text><text x=\"204\" y=\"176\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#23261f\" text-anchor=\"middle\">200</text><text x=\"276\" y=\"176\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#23261f\" text-anchor=\"middle\">calm</text><text x=\"348\" y=\"176\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#23261f\" text-anchor=\"middle\">yes</text><line x1=\"24\" y1=\"184\" x2=\"376\" y2=\"184\" stroke=\"#d9d4c7\" stroke-width=\"1\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><text x=\"200\" y=\"236\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Patterns show up after 20 entries:</text><text x=\"200\" y=\"254\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\" text-anchor=\"middle\">low misses = trigger, sideways = wind or NPOA</text>\n</svg>\n</figure><ul><li>Date, position, distance, wind, result (Tip).</li><li>20 entries show your real pattern (Tip).</li></ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>More: what the log tells you</summary><ul><li>Low misses often mean a jerked trigger or a flinch (Tip).</li><li>Misses left and right often mean wind or a bad natural point of aim (Tip).</li><li>Cold shot results over a month are your truest number (opinion).</li><li>Use the <a href=\"#/s/hunt-journal-guide/0\">hunt journal</a> or a page in a notebook.</li></ul></details>","<div class=\"tbl\"><table><thead><tr><th>Months</th><th>Focus</th><th>Live rounds a month</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Jan to Mar</td><td>Dry fire 3 nights a week, .22 days</td><td>0 to 20 .308</td></tr><tr><td>Apr to Jun</td><td>Range twice a month, positions, clays</td><td>20 to 30</td></tr><tr><td>Jul to Sep</td><td>Field drills, range test, pattern, zero</td><td>30 to 40</td></tr><tr><td>Oct to Dec</td><td>Confirm zero, hunt, log every shot</td><td>5 to 10</td></tr></tbody></table></div><ul><li>Opinion: a plan, not a rule.</li></ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>More: in season upkeep</summary><ul><li>Confirm zero after any knock, fall or long drive, and after travel by air (Tip).</li><li>Tikka: check scope mounts and screws as part of maintenance <span class=\"cert c-hi\" title=\"Certainty\">95%</span>. See <a href=\"#/s/firearm-care/0\">gun care</a>.</li><li>After the season: write down what you missed and why. That is next year's practice list (Tip).</li></ul></details>","<div class=\"tbl\"><table><thead><tr><th>Mistake</th><th>Fix</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Only bench groups</td><td>Cold shot from sticks every range day</td></tr><tr><td>Ammo in the dry fire room</td><td>Out of the room, every time</td></tr><tr><td>New load a week before the hunt</td><td>Freeze your setup now</td></tr></tbody></table></div><aside class=\"callout rule\"><div class=\"callout-t\">Grandpa's rule (wisdom, not law)</div><p>Grandpa's rule (wisdom): Practise the shot you will take, not the shot you like.</p></aside><details class=\"more\"><summary>More: the mistakes in full</summary><ul><li>Shooting perfect bench groups and never one cold shot from sticks.</li><li>Dry firing with a box of shells on the table.</li><li>Changing load, scope or rings the week before the hunt.</li></ul></details><aside class=\"callout field\"><div class=\"callout-t\">Do this in the field</div><p>Tonight: 10 minutes of session B. Tomorrow: the range, one cold shot, log it.</p></aside>","<figure class=\"diagram\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 400 300\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Memory hooks: 10 a day, minutes of dry fire. One cold shot: the first shot counts. No ammo in the dry fire room. Write it before you leave. Bump equals check: confirm zero after a knock.\">\n<rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"400\" height=\"300\" fill=\"#fffaf0\"/>\n<text x=\"200\" y=\"26\" font-size=\"18\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Memory hooks</text><rect x=\"20\" y=\"50\" width=\"360\" height=\"38\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#dfe6d3\" stroke=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"34\" y=\"75\" font-size=\"16\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#e8590c\" text-anchor=\"start\">10 a day</text><text x=\"170\" y=\"75\" font-size=\"15\" fill=\"#23261f\" text-anchor=\"start\">minutes of dry fire</text><rect x=\"20\" y=\"96\" width=\"360\" height=\"38\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#dfe6d3\" stroke=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"34\" y=\"121\" font-size=\"16\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#e8590c\" text-anchor=\"start\">1 cold shot</text><text x=\"170\" y=\"121\" font-size=\"15\" fill=\"#23261f\" text-anchor=\"start\">first shot counts</text><rect x=\"20\" y=\"142\" width=\"360\" height=\"38\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#dfe6d3\" stroke=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"34\" y=\"167\" font-size=\"16\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#e8590c\" text-anchor=\"start\">No ammo</text><text x=\"170\" y=\"167\" font-size=\"15\" fill=\"#23261f\" text-anchor=\"start\">in the dry fire room</text><rect x=\"20\" y=\"188\" width=\"360\" height=\"38\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#dfe6d3\" stroke=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"34\" y=\"213\" font-size=\"16\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#e8590c\" text-anchor=\"start\">Write it</text><text x=\"170\" y=\"213\" font-size=\"15\" fill=\"#23261f\" text-anchor=\"start\">before you leave</text><rect x=\"20\" y=\"234\" width=\"360\" height=\"38\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#dfe6d3\" stroke=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"34\" y=\"259\" font-size=\"16\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#e8590c\" text-anchor=\"start\">Bump = check</text><text x=\"170\" y=\"259\" font-size=\"15\" fill=\"#23261f\" text-anchor=\"start\">zero after a knock</text>\n</svg>\n</figure><ul><li><strong>\"Ten a day keeps the flinch away.\"</strong></li><li><strong>\"First shot counts.\"</strong></li><li><strong>\"No ammo in the room, no doom.\"</strong></li></ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>More: more memory tricks</summary><ul><li><strong>5 to 1:</strong> five dry sessions for each live one.</li><li><strong>\"Bump, check.\"</strong> Any knock: confirm zero.</li><li><strong>\"Freeze before the season.\"</strong> No new gear in the last two weeks.</li></ul></details>","<ul><li>Tikka and CZ manuals on dry fire <span class=\"cert c-hi\" title=\"Certainty\">95%</span>. Hunter education on sighting in <span class=\"cert c-mid\" title=\"Certainty\">85%</span>. Plans and drills: Hunt Mentor opinion. Checked 2026-10-11.</li></ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>More: all sources</summary><ul><li><a href=\"https://media.sako.global/image/upload/v1691658741/Tikka_T1x_T3x_Instruction_Manual_v5.3_cjggnu.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Tikka T1x and T3x manual v5.3</a>, dry firing and snap caps. Read directly 2026-10-11 <span class=\"cert c-hi\" title=\"Certainty\">95%</span></li><li><a href=\"https://czubpimstorage.blob.core.windows.net/strapi-pim/assets/735342000443_CZ_457_05_2025_en_es_cs_de_fr_8dc25ceb9d.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">CZ 457 manual</a>, dry firing. Read directly 2026-10-11 <span class=\"cert c-hi\" title=\"Certainty\">95%</span></li><li><a href=\"https://www.hunter-ed.com/national/studyGuide/Sighting-In-Procedure/201099_92884/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Hunter education: sighting in procedure</a>. Read 2026-10-11 <span class=\"cert c-mid\" title=\"Certainty\">85%</span></li><li>Ammunition prices: <a href=\"#/s/ammo-guide/0\">ammo session</a>, price checked 2026-10-01 <span class=\"cert c-lo\" title=\"Certainty\">65%</span></li><li>Clay plan: <a href=\"#/s/shotgun-skills/0\">shotgun skills</a> <span class=\"cert c-lo\" title=\"Certainty\">70%</span></li><li>Discharge and No Shooting Areas: <a href=\"#/s/rb-where-you-can-hunt/0\">Rule Book: where you can and cannot hunt</a> <span class=\"cert c-hi\" title=\"Certainty\">99%</span></li><li>Sprint, menu, range day and year plan: Hunt Mentor opinion</li></ul></details>"]